  "abstract": "Our implementation of a hybrid harmonic forecaster in factor space: factorized loadings U@V^T; per-factor multi-frequency head (M=12) predicts amplitudes/phases/frequencies to generate 32-step harmonics, plus a small per-factor increment head and residual copy. Global horizon gate \u03b3. Trained with MAE+temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4).",
